OL,3,GNEWSAChanges made to proposed pylons
OL,4,Ascheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a 37-mile pylon network in
OL,7,FLincolnshire and Leicestershire have
OL,8,Fbeen updated by National Grid.
OL,10,FThe scheme would run between Weston
OL,11,FMarsh, near Spalding, and east
OL,12,FLeicestershire. It was originally
OL,13,Fannounced in May last year.
OL,15,FAs well as the new overhead line,
OL,16,Fsubstations at Corby Glen, near Bourne,
OL,17,Fand Wartnaby, near Melton Mowbray,
OL,18,Fwould be built and about 40 miles of
OL,19,Fupgrades would be made to existing
OL,20,Foverhead lines.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
